instructions.purpose:
Change the user's named to-do lists: create, rename, delete, or set the end time of a list;
add, edit, tick, untick, move, or delete items. All operations of one call apply in order, all
or none.

tool.description:
Takes operations, each with an op:
create_list (name, optional items, optional endsAt);
set_expiry (listId, endsAt, or null to remove the end time);
rename_list (listId, name);
delete_list (listId);
add_items (listId, items, optional index to insert at, appended without one);
update_item (itemId, text and/or done);
move_item (itemId, toIndex);
delete_item (itemId).
Returns timezone, the changed lists in the shape list-lists returns (new lists and items
with their new ids), and deletedListIds.
